{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07606","headline":"送薛据之宋州 · 崔曙","name":"送薛据之宋州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无媒嗟失路，有道亦乘流。\n客处不堪别，异乡应共愁。\n我生早孤贱，沦落居此州。\n风土至今忆，山河皆昔游。\n一从文章事，两京春复秋。\n君去问相识，几人今白头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07606.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07606","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}